log","title":"익산 백제캠핑장 장비렌탈 후기 🏕️ 12만원에 풀세팅 캠핑 가능한 곳 (초보캠퍼 강추)","snippet":"생겨서 지나가면서 계속 보게 됨 🥹 (이름은 장군이!) 🌿 분위기 & 총평 캠핑장 곳곳에 석조 조형물들도 있고 나무도 많아서 분위기가 독특해요. 사실 여기는 폐교...진짜 가성비 갑이라고 생각해요. 초보캠퍼분들, 장비 없는 분들, 아이 있는 가족분들한테 강추합니다 🏕️ 📌 백제…","url":"https://blog.naver.com/jwh0125/224282495228","src":"Jimmy's Diary","thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/AWxVO942rkZ","date":"2026-05-12"}],"sns_images":[{"thumb":"https://search1.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/ADjxkDSSHSo","img":"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/uJa60/btsJZOvCIVX/TnJCVMSuCg5kF5YX7qBUdK/img.png","url":"https://intotvingin.tistory.com/606","src":"티스토리","w":1523,"h":848,"date":"2024-11-28"},{"thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/3aY5Z39BCZO","img":"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/0KJpu/btsJ06a31uU/2UXFFdmkFX8esCsHo8ddZ1/img.png","url":"https://intotvingin.tistory.com/606","src":"티스토리","w":614,"h":444,"date":"2024-11-28"},{"thumb":"https://search2.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/BprtY3tBXk2","img":"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/20140729_28/kang4044_1406599350084lHMFI_JPEG/%C0%CD%BB%EA_%BF%F5%C6%F7_%C4%B7%C7%CE%C0%E52.jpg?type=w2","url":"https://blog.naver.com/kang4044/220075103141","src":"네이버블로그","w":650,"h":434,"date":"2014-07-29"},{"thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/83T7ZaxpegN","img":"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/NIUM4/btsPkReHa1U/Ss2jOFQtwGkAk71pKfdSzk/img.jpg","url":"https://campingenjoy.tistory.com/1681","src":"티스토리","w":800,"h":600,"date":"2025-07-17"},{"thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/4sstXDVpQUD","img":"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzA3MjRfNDkg/MDAxNjkwMTg0NDQ1NzM1.weW8FuJavJ2GK5gUVJzdSzxyYWi1W4tjuf26slqzwiwg.-Edp4KBI4uh0cLOBm_SHeYRGmAtVHW0aixfgXUravS8g.JPEG.mcstkorea/%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%8423.jpg?type=w966","url":"https://blog.naver.com/mcstkorea/223166427236","src":"네이버블로그","w":966,"h":725,"date":"2023-07-26"},{"thumb":"https://search2.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/8mlnvl5HyfF","img":"https://c2.staticflickr.com/6/5705/22301583